<resources>

    <!--
        Material 3 themes. Every screen keeps its original style name, but the
        AppCompat parents are replaced by Material 3 DayNight parents, so the
        app now follows the system dark mode. The "surface" color roles come
        from the values-night color qualifier, chromatic roles come from the
        selected palette (ThemeColors). Dynamic colors (Android 12+) overlay
        the palette when enabled in the settings.
    -->

